            "| Command          | What it does                                                         |",
            "| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |",
            "| `pnpm dev`       | Serves the deck with hot reload                                      |",
            "| `pnpm build`     | Type-checks and builds a static site into `dist/`                    |",
            "| `pnpm preview`   | Serves the build                                                     |",
            "| `pnpm typecheck` | Type-checks the code and the slides without building                 |",
            "| `pnpm export`    | Builds and writes `slides.pdf`, a page per slide, to `.tmp/export/`  |",
            "| `pnpm check`     | Type-checks, builds, and fails on a slide whose content does not fit |",
