          "added": [
            "## Export and checks",
            "",
            "`pnpm export` builds the deck and prints it with Chrome to `.tmp/export/slides.pdf`. After a build, `node scripts/export.ts` takes options: `--steps` for a page per step, `--png` for an image per page, `--theme dark`, and `--out <directory>`.",
            "",
